ent[v] = u;\n                        if (v == t)\n                            break;\n                        q.add(v);\n                    }\n                }\n                if (seen[t])\n                    break;\n            }\n\n            if (!seen[t])\n                break;\n\n            int add = INF;\n            for (int v = t; v != s; v = parent[v])\n                add = Math.min(add, cap[parent[v]][v] - flow[parent[v]][v]);\n\n            for (int v = t; v != s; v = parent[v]) {\n                flow[parent[v]][v] += add;\n                flow[v][parent[v]] -= add;\n            }\n\n            ret += add;\n        }\n        return ret;\n    }\n}\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MAX = 12;\n    static int n, t, zx, zy;\n    static char[][] smp = new char[MAX][MAX];\n    static char[][] cmp = new char[MAX][MAX];\n    static char[][] work = new char[MAX][MAX];\n    static int[][] vis = new int[MAX][MAX];\n    static int[] dx = {1, 0, -1, 0};\n    static int[] dy = {0, -1, 0, 1};\n\n    static int X(int i, int j) { return i * n + j; }\n    static int Y(int i, int j) { return n * n + i * n + j; }\n    static int S() { return n * n * 2; }\n    static int T() { return S() + 1; }\n    static int N() { return T() + 1; }\n\n    static class qNode {\n        int x, y, t, type;\n        qNode() {}\n        qNode(int x, int y, int t, int type) {\n            this.x = x;\n            this.y = y;\n            this.t = t;\n            this.type = type;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void bfs(int sx, int sy) {\n        Queue<qNode> q = new LinkedList<>();\n        q.add(new qNode(sx, sy, 0, 0));\n        vis[sx][sy] = 1;\n        q.add(new qNode(zx, zy, 0, 1));\n        while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n            qNode u = q.poll();\n            int nx, ny;\n            if (u.t == t)\n                break;\n            if (u.type == 0 && Character.isLetter(work[u.x][u.y]))\n                continue;\n            for (int i = 0; i < 4; ++i) {\n                nx = u.x + dx[i];\n                ny = u.y + dy[i];\n                if (nx >= 0 && nx < n && ny >= 0 && ny < n) {\n                    if (u.type == 0 && vis[nx][ny] == 0 && !Character.isLetter(work[nx][ny])) {\n                        vis[nx][ny] = 1;\n                        q.add(new qNode(nx, ny, u.t + 1, 0));\n                    }\n                    else if (u.type == 1 && !Character.isLetter(work[nx][ny])) {\n                        work[nx][ny] = 'Z';\n                        q.add(new qNode(nx, ny, u.t + 1, 1));\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        MaxFlow mf = new MaxFlow();\n        while (sc.hasNextInt()) {\n            n = sc.nextInt();\n            t = sc.nextInt();\n            mf.init(N(), S(), T());\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n                String line = sc.next();\n                for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n                    smp[i][j] = line.charAt(j);\n                    if (Character.isDigit(smp[i][j]) && smp[i][j] > '0')\n                        mf.addEdge(S(), X(i, j), smp[i][j] - '0');\n                    else if (smp[i][j] == 'Z') {\n                        zx = i;\n                        zy = j;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n                String line = sc.next();\n                for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n                    cmp[i][j] = line.charAt(j);\n                    if (Character.isDigit(cmp[i][j]) && cmp[i][j] > '0')\n                        mf.addEdge(Y(i, j), T(), cmp[i][j] - '0');\n                }\n            }\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i)\n                for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n                    if (!Character.isDigit(smp[i][j]) || smp[i][j] <= '0')\n                        continue;\n                    for (int[] row : vis)\n                        Arrays